// Worldgen harness (P7.2): the chunk generator stack -
//   - RandomSupport/Xoroshiro/XoroshiroRandomSource: the exact Java vectors
//     (the reference values generated by the vendored vendor code paths)
//   - ImprovedNoise/PerlinNoise/NormalNoise: the seeding order + the sampled
//     values against the JVM reference run
//   - FlatLevelSource: the superflat recipe end to end (fillFromNoise over
//     the sections, the WG heightmaps, getBaseHeight/getSpawnHeight)
//   - the biome identity: the interning + the SerializableChunkData palette
//     roundtrip through the section biome

